nes; and constructs new infrastructure, as well as the augmentation of existing infrastructure for various power distribution companies and agencies. It also engages in rural/urban electrification; primary distribution substation; and underground cabling activities. In addition, the company designs, manufactures, supplies, and installs monopoles; designs and manufactures a range of transmission, distribution poles, including single poles, twin poles, and special structures, such as cable termination poles, three poles, or quad structures; and tubular substation structures. Further, it provides lattice structure, steel tubular poles, lighting poles and masts; and galvanizing services. Bajel Projects Limited was incorporated in 2022 and is based in Mumbai, India."}}